      "type": "slideset",
      "source": "canonical",
      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Open OpenDefence Main",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap <strong>≡</strong>, scroll the tools to <strong>OpenDefence Main</strong> and tap it. <strong>Wash out the map</strong> lays white over the map, so it turns paler, not darker, and marks stand out.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/79ec74a1cf62834d.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Pick how pale",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Under <strong>Wash out the map</strong>, pick <strong>25 %</strong>, <strong>50 %</strong> or <strong>75 %</strong>, here <strong>50 %</strong>. Your arrow and the marks keep their full colour.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/2761676560b60764.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Check the map",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Close the pane with <strong>✕</strong> to see the marks stand out. To bring the map back, open <strong>OpenDefence Main</strong> again and pick <strong>Off</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/3a0bfa7feb182dac.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
